        <rdfs:isDefinedBy xml:lang="en">One of the lower animals (i.e. less advanced in the scale of evolutionary development) as distinguished from human beings.

Reference:
Merriam-Webster (https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/animal)</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Class>
    


